{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601310","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1460131001:1":{"text":"긴 토론 끝에, 우리는 마침내 구체적인 경기 일정, 테마, 그리고 규칙을 정할 수 있었다.","source_cn":"经历了漫长的讨论后，你们终于确定了具体的赛程、主题和规则。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84799B78C0B6B0F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1460131002:0":{"text":"그런 다음, 우리는 각지에서 오랫동안 기다리고 있을 친구들에게 보낼 편지를 돌리에게 건네주었다.","source_cn":"紧接着，你们将信件交给多莉，分发给了各地等待已久的朋友们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D2C296B495BB08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1460131003:0":{"text":"그리고 땅거미 숲에 도전하고 싶어 안달이 난 사람이 있었으니...","source_cn":"在薄暮丛林，有人跃跃欲试……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65BC850003B8B543","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460131004:1":{"text":"그럼 난 우선 성석 마을로 가서 도전하도록 할게.","source_cn":"那么，我就先出发去尝试下圣石镇那边的挑战了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE28ED35143E293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1460131005:1":{"text":"잠깐! 왜 그렇게 급하게 가는 거야!","source_cn":"等等！走那么急干什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x790EFCF8DB9D1EBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1460131006:1":{"text":"전에 말했잖아. 네가 진행을 맡지 않는다면 다른 참가자와 똑같은 입장이라고!","source_cn":"之前都说过了，既然你不来负责主持，那就一视同仁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD41278AB6F6763F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1460131007:1":{"text":"각지를 돌아다니기 전에 우선 우리 쪽에서 증명서를 받아야 해!","source_cn":"在巡礼各地前，先从我们这里拿到凭证才行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F25EC17E26E7E6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1460131008:0":{"text":"좋아, 그럼 어디 한 번 해보자!","source_cn":"好极了，来试试看吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9B0B8F48454B7C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1460131009:1":{"text":"그리고 성석 마을에서 누군가가 불난 집에 부채질을 하고 있었는데...","source_cn":"而在圣石镇，有人煽风点火……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E55747455AA0AB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1460131010:1":{"text":"난 대회 준비든, 참가든 할 생각이 없어.","source_cn":"我是不打算组织赛事，也不打算参赛啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA91D28E944D44F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1460131011:1":{"text":"그러니 나 대신 둘이 참가자를 선별하는 게 어떨까?","source_cn":"所以，就拜托二位女士来筛选这些参赛者如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x582F5BD7C9615D22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1460131012:1":{"text":"멀린 님을 만나려면 우리부터 이겨라! 뭐, 그런 거지.","source_cn":"要想见到梅林大人，就必须通过你们这关——之类的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB63F6A7752736721","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린 님을 만나려면 우리부터 이겨라! 뭐, 그런 거지.","female":"멀린 님을 만나려면 우리부터 이겨라! 뭐, 그런 거지.","variant_male_record_index":"168512","variant_female_record_index":"168513","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1460131013:1":{"text":"책임감이 막중하네요! 발렌 씨, 최선을 다할게요!","source_cn":"责任重大！维伦先生，我会尽力而为！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB70A553DD271138B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1460131014:1":{"text":"이 녀석의 꾀에 넘어가지 말라고.","source_cn":"别上了这家伙的钩啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0D1342D452A32A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1460131015:1":{"text":"그런 시시한 이유를 대는 것보다 “내 눈앞에 나타나서 말하는 성가신 녀석을 태워버리고 싶네”라고 하는 게 더 나을 것 같은데.","source_cn":"与其说那种无聊的理由，还不如“我想烧掉出现在我眼前会说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x973268C4A9A477DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1460131016:1":{"text":"미라엘 씨는 역시 화염의 마녀답네요...","source_cn":"米瑞尔小姐在大部分时间都还是灰烬魔女的做派呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB80661D8B685C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:26:1460131017:1":{"text":"게스트 하우스에서는 누군가 허풍을 떨고 있었다...","source_cn":"在客金旅店里，有人正在吹嘘——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46B1B3B6933207C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1460131018:1":{"text":"그러니까 내 말은! 내가 배를 몰고 너희를 사막으로 데려다준다니까!","source_cn":"所以我说！我到时候就会开着船，带你们去沙漠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63D89A3F212FAAA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1460131019:1":{"text":"하지만 사막에 항구가 있긴 한가...? 그게 무슨 상관이야! 어쨌든 난 이 머시기 퍼레이드 감독관이기도 하다고!","source_cn":"话说沙漠有没有港口啊……不管这个了！总之这什么巡礼，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F6A5591FC047C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1460131020:1":{"text":"아이고! 아파라!\n루카, 왜 때려?","source_cn":"哎哟！好疼！\\n卢卡，你打我干嘛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE04CB2F63FBD034D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1460131021:1":{"text":"네가 맞을 짓을 하니까 때렸지. 감독관은 네가 아니라, 나랑 소니아라고!","source_cn":"打的就是你，考官是我和索尼娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14AF3BDD0AD1F340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1460131022:1":{"text":"우리가 조금 전까지 경기 일정 리스트를 정리했으니까,. 넌 이 리스트대로 내일까지 경기를 끝내고 러스트 항의 증명서를 받아오도록 해!","source_cn":"我们刚刚定好了赛程列表，你，照着这个表，明天之前给我打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6DFECD16B307762","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1460131023:1":{"text":"뭐? 내가? 내일까지?!","source_cn":"啊？我？明天之前？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x452C5F6AE39DB7EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1460131024:1":{"text":"당연하지. 방금 네가 직접 참가 선수들을 위해 배를 몰겠다고 했잖아?","source_cn":"那当然，谁让你自己说，要给参赛选手们开船！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44252C65BB184B78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1460131025:0":{"text":"증명서를 손에 넣으면 배와 보급품을 정비하도록 하고. 자, 어서 움직이라고!","source_cn":"拿完证明就去整备船只和补给，快，动起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2600E759DA21B33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:40:1460131026:1":{"text":"한편, 장원의 유적 깊숙한 곳에서는 누군가가 불안한 기색을 감추지 못하고 있었다...","source_cn":"在庄园的旧址，也有人正在忐忑不安……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0B1CF16B38E983D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1460131027:1":{"text":"오늘 경기에 참가해 주셔서 정말 감사합니다... 아니지.","source_cn":"非常感谢诸位今日愿意来参赛……不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51ECE5C42E338A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1460131028:1":{"text":"예선전에 참가해 주셔서 감사합니다... 음, 이것도 아니야.","source_cn":"感谢诸位今日到场，参加这场预选赛……唔，还是不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D77534C300B989B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1460131029:0":{"text":"캐롤라이나, 아주 오래, 외웠다.","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，你背了，好久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBD3496941DDFBE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1460131030:0":{"text":"음, 이고르가 실수하지 않게 예절을 가르쳐 줘야겠는걸.","source_cn":"唔，我得教教伊戈尔，别在台上太失礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7EC6A1247331128","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1460131031:0":{"text":"이고르! 인사하는 법을 가르쳐 줄 테니까 이리 와... 이고르? 이고르!","source_cn":"伊戈尔！过来，跟我学问候……伊戈尔，人呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x427DA64D81657884","var